Models
------
Models are not bundled with Interlo and are not in this repository. The owner
downloads them from inside the app. Each model keeps its own licence.

1. Silero VAD (speech gate, ONNX)
   Licence: MIT. Source: see docs/m0/candidates.md.

2. PhoWhisper (Vietnamese speech recognition; small, base as fallback)
   Licence: BSD-3-Clause. Copyright 2024 VinAI.
   Source: see docs/m0/candidates.md.

3. opus-mt vi-en and en-vi (translation, Marian family)
   Licence: Apache-2.0 (model card tag; the card has no licence text).
   The models were trained on OPUS corpora that carry their own terms, and the
   training data is listed as CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 in docs/tech-stack.md.
   The data terms are still an open check (see docs/m0/candidates.md).
   Source: see docs/m0/candidates.md.
   Licence screen: the app shows this licence and a non-commercial flag before
   download and asks you to accept (D-47).

4. ZeroTTS (Vietnamese and English voices, ONNX)
   Licence: MIT for the code and the weights. The codec decoder graphs are
   Apache-2.0. Source: see docs/m0/candidates.md.
   Language support: Vietnamese, with English words inside Vietnamese text
   (project README and model card).
   Licence screen: the app shows this licence and a non-commercial flag before
   download and asks you to accept (D-47).

The speaker model and the summary model are not chosen yet. They will be listed
here when they are, with their licences.

Fonts
-----
Three font families are bundled in the app and loaded from the app itself
(apps/ui/src/assets/fonts), never from the network. All three are under the
SIL Open Font License 1.1. The copyright line of each family is below, and the
full licence text is in the file `*-OFL.txt` beside the font files, copied from each
family's own repository (read 2026-11-23). The files are the
`woff2` files that Google Fonts serves for the Latin, Latin extended and, where
the family has it, Vietnamese ranges. Downloaded 2026-11-20 from
https://fonts.gstatic.com/ with the owner's approval.

F1. Bricolage Grotesque (headings, the brand and the large subtitle; variable
    weight 500 to 700). Copyright 2022 The Bricolage Grotesque Project Authors
    (https://github.com/ateliertriay/bricolage). Licence file: display-OFL.txt.
    Files: display-latin.woff2 (76868 bytes),
    display-latin-ext.woff2 (30636), display-vietnamese.woff2 (13060).
F2. Instrument Sans (body text, buttons and tables; variable weight 400 to
    600). Copyright 2022 The Instrument Sans Project Authors
    (https://github.com/Instrument/instrument-sans). Licence file: text-OFL.txt.
    Files: text-latin.woff2 (29904), text-latin-ext.woff2 (11092). The
    family has no Vietnamese range: letters such as the tone-marked vowels fall
    back to the system font.
F3. JetBrains Mono (timers, timestamps, tags and key caps; variable weight 400
    to 500). Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
    (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono). Licence file: mono-OFL.txt.
    Files: mono-latin.woff2 (31340), mono-latin-ext.woff2 (11596),
    mono-vietnamese.woff2 (5872).

