Libraries
---------
The libraries below are named in docs/tech-stack.md. That file does not record
their licences. Each library carries its own licence file; Cargo.lock and
apps/ui/package-lock.json pin the exact versions. A full licence list for the
shipped build is still to be generated before a release (TODO).

Rust: serde, serde_json, thiserror, rusqlite (bundled SQLite), tauri 2,
tauri-build 2. Planned: cpal, rubato, ort (ONNX Runtime), tokio.

UI: react, react-dom, vite, @vitejs/plugin-react, typescript, vitest, jsdom,
@testing-library/react, @testing-library/user-event, @playwright/test, eslint,
@eslint/js, typescript-eslint, eslint-plugin-react-hooks, prettier,
@types/node, @types/react, @types/react-dom. Most of these are build and test
tools and are not shipped in the app.
